[Thinking]
**Creating a CSGO website**

I need to provide a simple answer for a complete HTML page for a CSGO website. It might be a good idea to include CSS and JavaScript all in one file for convenience. Although the user may also be thinking about Counter-Strike 2, the request focuses on a CSGO website. So, I’ll aim to create a complete HTML landing page that meets these needs. Let’s get started on crafting that!
[/Thinking]

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>CSGO Arena</title>
  <meta name="description" content="A complete CSGO themed website with news, maps, teams, tournaments, and contact sections." />
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background: #0b0f14;
      color: #ffffff;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: inherit;
    }

    img {
      max-width: 100%;
      display: block;
    }

    .container {
      width: 90%;
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    /* Header */
    header {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #0f1720, #131c28);
      border-bottom: 1px solid #1f2a38;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 1000;
    }

    .navbar {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 18px 0;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 1.7rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #f59e0b;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      color: #d1d5db;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
      color: #f59e0b;
    }

    .menu-toggle {
      display: none;
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      color: #fff;
    }

    /* Hero */
    .hero {
      min-height: 90vh;
      background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.65), rgba(0,0,0,0.75)),
        url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542751371-adc38448a05e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80") center/cover no-repeat;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .hero-content {
      max-width: 650px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 3.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .hero h1 span {
      color: #f59e0b;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: #e5e7eb;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .btn-group {
      display: flex;
      gap: 15px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 22px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: bold;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: #f59e0b;
      color: #111827;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      background: #ffb833;
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      border: 2px solid #f59e0b;
      color: #f59e0b;
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background: #f59e0b;
      color: #111827;
    }

    /* Sections */
    section {
      padding: 70px 0;
    }

    .section-title {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .section-title h2 {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      color: #f59e0b;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .section-title p {
      color: #9ca3af;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    /* Cards */
    .grid {
      display: grid;
      gap: 25px;
    }

    .grid-3 {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    }

    .card {
      background: #131a24;
      border: 1px solid #1f2937;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
    }

    .card-content {
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .card h3 {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .card p {
      color: #cbd5e1;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .tag {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #f59e0b;
      color: #111827;
      padding: 5px 10px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    /* Stats */
    .stats {
      background: #0f1720;
    }

    .stats-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .stat-box {
      background: #131a24;
      padding: 25px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid #1f2937;
    }

    .stat-box h3 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      color: #f59e0b;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .stat-box p {
      color: #cbd5e1;
    }

    /* Tournament table */
    .table-wrapper {
      overflow-x: auto;
      background: #131a24;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid #1f2937;
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      min-width: 700px;
    }

    table th,
    table td {
      padding: 16px;
      text-align: left;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #1f2937;
    }

    table th {
      background: #0f1720;
      color: #f59e0b;
    }

    table td {
      color: #d1d5db;
    }

    /* Contact */
    .contact-wrapper {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 30px;
    }

    form {
      background: #131a24;
      padding: 25px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid #1f2937;
    }

    form input,
    form textarea {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      border: 1px solid #374151;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: #0b0f14;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    form textarea {
      resize: vertical;
      min-height: 130px;
    }

    form button {
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .contact-info {
      background: #131a24;
      padding: 25px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid #1f2937;
    }

    .contact-info h3 {
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      color: #f59e0b;
    }

    .contact-info p {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      color: #d1d5db;
    }

    /* Footer */
    footer {
      background: #0f1720;
      border-top: 1px solid #1f2937;
      padding: 25px 0;
      text-align: center;
      color: #9ca3af;
    }

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .nav-links {
        display: none;
        flex-direction: column;
        background: #111827;
        position: absolute;
        top: 70px;
        right: 5%;
        width: 220px;
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        border: 1px solid #1f2937;
      }

      .nav-links.active {
        display: flex;
      }

      .menu-toggle {
        display: block;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 2.3rem;
      }

      .hero p {
        font-size: 1rem;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <div class="container navbar">
      <div class="logo">CSGO Arena</div>
      <div class="menu-toggle" id="menu-toggle">&#9776;</div>
      <ul class="nav-links" id="nav-links">
        <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
        <li><a href="#news">News</a></li>
        <li><a href="#maps">Maps</a></li>
        <li><a href="#teams">Teams</a></li>
        <li><a href="#tournaments">Tournaments</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="hero" id="home">
    <div class="container hero-content">
      <h1>Welcome to <span>CSGO Arena</span></h1>
      <p>
        Your ultimate destination for Counter-Strike: Global Offensive updates,
        maps, team rankings, tournament coverage, and competitive gaming content.
      </p>
      <div class="btn-group">
        <a href="#news" class="btn btn-primary">Latest News</a>
        <a href="#tournaments" class="btn btn-secondary">View Tournaments</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="news">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-title">
        <h2>Latest News</h2>
        <p>Stay updated with the newest CSGO events, patch notes, roster changes, and esports highlights.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-3">
        <div class="card">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511512578047-dfb367046420?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="CSGO tournament news">
          <div class="card-content">
            <span class="tag">Esports</span>
            <h3>Major Championship Finals Announced</h3>
            <p>The biggest CSGO teams are ready to face off in the grand final after a thrilling semifinal showdown.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1526374965328-7f61d4dc18c5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="CSGO patch update">
          <div class="card-content">
            <span class="tag">Update</span>
            <h3>New Patch Brings Weapon Balance Changes</h3>
            <p>Valve has introduced fresh adjustments to rifles, pistols, and map rotations to refine competitive play.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1545239351-1141bd82e8a6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="CSGO team news">
          <div class="card-content">
            <span class="tag">Teams</span>
            <h3>Top Team Signs Rising Star</h3>
            <p>A promising new player joins one of the top rosters, creating excitement ahead of the next big tournament.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="stats">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-title">
        <h2>Community Stats</h2>
        <p>A quick look at the CSGO competitive scene and global player activity.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stats-grid">
        <div class="stat-box">
          <h3>24M+</h3>
          <p>Registered Players</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-box">
          <h3>1.2M</h3>
          <p>Daily Active Users</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-box">
          <h3>7</h3>
          <p>Active Duty Maps</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-box">
          <h3>500+</h3>
          <p>Pro Tournaments</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="maps">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-title">
        <h2>Popular Maps</h2>
        <p>Explore the iconic battlegrounds that define CSGO strategy and competitive gameplay.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-3">
        <div class="card">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500530855697-b586d89ba3ee?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Dust 2 map">
          <div class="card-content">
            <h3>Dust II</h3>
            <p>One of the most iconic and balanced maps in CSGO history, known for its simple layout and intense mid control.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518770660439-4636190af475?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Mirage map">
          <div class="card-content">
            <h3>Mirage</h3>
            <p>A fan-favorite map with fast rotations, tactical utility usage, and highly contested mid engagements.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1493711662062-fa541adb3fc8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Inferno map">
          <div class="card-content">
            <h3>Inferno</h3>
            <p>Famous for tight chokepoints, banana control, and dramatic executes that reward coordination and timing.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="teams">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-title">
        <h2>Top Teams</h2>
        <p>Meet some of the strongest teams dominating the international CSGO scene.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-3">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-content">
            <span class="tag">Rank #1</span>
            <h3>Natus Vincere</h3>
            <p>A powerhouse roster known for aggressive aim, smart mid-round calls, and world-class star players.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-content">
            <span class="tag">Rank #2</span>
            <h3>FaZe Clan</h3>
            <p>International talent combined with elite mechanical skill makes FaZe one of the most dangerous teams.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-content">
            <span class="tag">Rank #3</span>
            <h3>G2 Esports</h3>
            <p>Known for explosive entries, crisp teamwork, and a loyal fanbase across the competitive gaming world.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="tournaments">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-title">
        <h2>Upcoming Tournaments</h2>
        <p>Track major CSGO events, dates, locations, and prize pools.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="table-wrapper">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Tournament</th>
              <th>Date</th>
              <th>Location</th>
              <th>Prize Pool</th>
              <th>Status</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>CSGO World Masters</td>
              <td>June 15, 2026</td>
              <td>Berlin, Germany</td>
              <td>$1,000,000</td>
              <td>Open</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Global Strike League</td>
              <td>July 03, 2026</td>
              <td>Stockholm, Sweden</td>
              <td>$750,000</td>
              <td>Upcoming</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Inferno Invitational</td>
              <td>August 20, 2026</td>
              <td>Los Angeles, USA</td>
              <td>$500,000</td>
              <td>Registration Live</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Dust II Championship</td>
              <td>September 10, 2026</td>
              <td>Dubai, UAE</td>
              <td>$600,000</td>
              <td>Announced</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-title">
        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>Have questions, suggestions, or want to partner with our CSGO platform? Reach out below.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-wrapper">
        <form>
          <input type="text" placeholder="Your Name" required />
          <input type="email" placeholder="Your Email" required />
          <input type="text" placeholder="Subject" required />
          <textarea placeholder="Your Message" required></textarea>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Send Message</button>
        </form>

        <div class="contact-info">
          <h3>Get in Touch</h3>
          <p><strong>Email:</strong> contact@csgoarena.com</p>
          <p><strong>Discord:</strong> CSGOArena#2026</p>
          <p><strong>Twitter:</strong> @CSGOArena</p>
          <p><strong>Location:</strong> Global Esports Network</p>
          <p>
            Follow us for tournament updates, live match coverage, roster news,
            and gameplay tips from the competitive CSGO scene.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <div class="container">
      <p>&copy; 2026 CSGO Arena. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    const menuToggle = document.getElementById("menu-toggle");
    const navLinks = document.getElementById("nav-links");

    menuToggle.addEventListener("click", () => {
      navLinks.classList.toggle("active");
    });
  </script>

</body>
</html>
```

If you want, I can also make it:
1. more modern,
2. gaming-styled with animations,
3. connected to Bootstrap,
4. or split into separate HTML/CSS/JS files.

